    70  *> Changes:
    71  *> 20/09/2025 vbc - 1.0.00 Created - starting. Prior to testing.
    72  *>                         After testing version will be set to v3.3.
    73  *>                         WARNING: You MUST set the terminal program to be 80
    74  *>                         cols wide and MORE than 25 lines deep and this is to
    75  *>                         allow for the some of the extra lines beyond 24 to
    76  *>                         be used as areas for the warning or error messages
    77  *>                         to be displayed. 26 lines is the minimum.
    78  *>                         This procedure must be applied at all times when
    79  *>                         running Payroll.
    80  *>                         For almost all terminal programs, can be achieved
    81  *>                         by pulling the left and bottom edges of the terminal
    82  *>                         screen with the mouse and holding right button and
    83  *>                         pulling until the correct number is displayed, and
    84  *>                         doing so, one at a time or pulling bottom right
    85  *>                         corner.
    86  *>
    87  *> 30/10/2025 vbc -        Still working on file rec layouts (ws)+ selects (sel)
    88  *>                         & fd's (fd).
    89  *> 05/11/2025 vbc -        Adding more SS for data input or display and menus.
    90  *>                         Some of which may well go into another program.
    91  *> 23/11/2025 vbc -    .01 Added support for GL for account nos, Testing for
    92  *>                         reset numbers in IRS and GL when building default
    93  *>                         accounts as they may well not exist AND test for
    94  *>                         errors when writing accounts file which will cause an
    95  *>                         abort of this initial creating file functions on first
    96  *>                         using Payroll as a fatal condition.
    97  *>                         Renamed zz section / paragraphs that are normal
    98  *>                         functions into new names starting with ab000 etc
    99  *>                         as very messy.
   100  *>                         WARNING - Absolutely no testing done for GL as I have
   101  *>                         no idea about USA GL CoA's. Might try and reseach
   102  *>                         this at some point when coding completed.
   103  *>                         IN which case these comments will be removed -
   104  *>                         providing I remember.
   105  *> 27/11/2025 vbc -    .02 Screen size now checked for Minimum of 27 lines.
   106  *>                         All other programs wil do the same. Msg SY010 chgd.
   107  *> 28/11/2025 vbc -    .03 Added capture for Tax-ID.
   108  *> 30/11/2025 vbc -    .04 Added State code and test for Co.State for validity.
