  3029  *>        FEDERAL WITHHOLDING TAX TABLE ENTRY
  3030  *>**
  3031  *> The Payroll System did supply the current Federal withholding tax table.
  3032  *> Income tax withholding is based on the percentage method
  3033  *> (see IRS circular E, Employer's Tax Guide), using the
  3034  *> ANNUAL payroll period table. WARNING it is NOT up to date.
  3035  *>
  3036  *> The System Deduction Entry program (py900) lets you
  3037  *> change this table when needed.  See Chapter 22 for details.
