  3060  *> Force Esc, PgUp, PgDown, PrtSC to be detected
  3061       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_EXCEPTIONS" to "Y".
  3062       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_ESC" to "Y".
  3063       move     current-Date to WSE-Date-block.
  3064  *>
  3065       perform  forever
  3066                accept   WS-Env-Lines   from lines
  3067                if       WS-Env-Lines < 28
  3068                         display  SY010    at 0101 with erase eos
  3069                         accept   WS-Reply at 0133
