  4495  *>**********************************
  4496  *>
  4497  *> REMEMBER to save in WS-Dflt Cash (1), Liability (2),
  4498  *>                     WS-Dflt-Cost (4) & WS-Dflt-Expense ( PY-PR1-Dflt-Dist-Acct )
  4499  *>
  4500       move     zero to Return-Code.
  4501       perform  acasirsub1-Open-Input.
  4502       if       WE-Error not = zero
  4503                display  IR912    at line WS-23-lines col 01 with foreground-color cob-color-red erase eol
  4504                display  "21" at line WS-23-lines col 52
  4505                move     21 to PY-PR1-Status
  4506                perform  ZZ040-Evaluate-Message
  4507                display  WS-Eval-Msg at line WS-23-lines col 55
  4508                display  SY003    at line WS-lines col 01 with foreground-color cob-color-red erase eol
  4509                accept   WS-Reply at line WS-lines col 52 AUTO
