  4512                go       to ab030-Exit.                    *> Cannot continue.
  4513  *>
  4514  *>  NL nominal # preset only via IRS but numbers used are suspect.
  4515  *>   we test that these numers exist & if not, abort this function
  4516  *>  do the same if errors exist when writing record
  4517  *>  and if error happened clear the act file.
  4518  *>
  4519  *>  THEREFORE if file is zero size this routined failed regardless of what one of
  4520  *>  the four caused it.   BUT should not be happening :(
  4521  *>
  4522       move     spaces to WS-Account-Table.         *> Init Table
  4523       open     input    PY-Accounts-File.
  4524       if       PY-Act-Status not = "00"
  4525                close    PY-Accounts-File
  4526                open     output PY-Accounts-File   *> set up the default accounts
  4527                move     1 to ACT-No
  4528                move     "Cash" to ACT-Desc
  4529                move     00274  to ACT-GL-No
  4530                perform  ab035-Find-IRS-Nominal-Acct
  4531                if       we-error not = zero
  4532                         move     zeros to ACT-GL-No
  4533                else
  4534                         move     "Y" to WS-Act-Exists (ACT-No)
