  5265  *>C      copy "Proc-ZZ100-ACAS-IRS-Calls.cob"
  5266  *>C           replacing LEADING ==zz100-== by ==ZZ900-==.
  5267  *>
  5268   zz100-ACAS-IRS-Calls  section.
  5269  *>============================
  5270  *>
  5271  *>  USED THROUGHTOUT IRS but Map out by using a dummy 03 all
  5272  *>   unused acasirsubn routines [see 01  Dummies-For-Unused-FH-Calls].
  5273  *>
  5274  *> All of the calls to irsub1 - 5 remapped to acasirsub1 - 5.
  5275  *>        All require changes to code for param etc.
  5276  *>
  5277  *>  Uses messages:  IR911, IR912, IR913, IR915, IR916. (Was IR011 - 16.
  5278  *>
  5279  *>  Note irsub2 is replaced by acas000 with File-Key-No=1
  5280  *> ******************************************************
  5281  *>
  5282  *> acas000     =  System parameter file processing with File-Key-No=1
  5283  *>
  5284  *> Changes:
  5285  *> 29/04/18 vbc - 1.01 - Changed all accessing other than open with 1st line of
  5286  *>                       move zero to Access-Type to keep logging clean.
  5287  *>
  5288   acas000.
  5289  *>
  5290       move     1 to File-Key-No.               *> 1 = Primary as only used.
  5291       call     "acas000" using
  5292                                  WS-System-Record
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY900    24/03/2026  18:58:24:61                                  Page   99

  5293                                  File-Access
  5294                                  File-Defs
  5295                                  ACAS-DAL-Common-data
  5296       end-call.
  5297  *>
  5298  *> acas008     =  SL/PL Posting file processing
  5299  *>
  5300   acas008.
  5301  *>
  5302       move     1 to File-Key-No.               *> 1 = Primary
  5303       call     "acas008" using WS-System-Record
  5304                                WS-IRS-Posting-Record
  5305                                File-Access
  5306                                File-Defs
  5307                                ACAS-DAL-Common-data.
  5308  *>
